  ('sop_my_payslips_action_screen', 'Which Screen to Use When Acting on My Space Payslips & Net Pay History', 'where_to_find', 'hr', 'Use /me/payslips to perform any operational action related to My Space Payslips & Net Pay History.', 'Because Zoe follows the CEO''s strict read-only rule, she never modifies Welile records. After checking My Space Payslips & Net Pay History in Zoe, navigate to /me/payslips to record calls, update tasks, or submit approvals.', 'Zoe will always name /me/payslips if asked to mutate records covered by assistant_staff_my_payslips.', 'assistant_staff_my_payslips', '/me/payslips', ARRAY['my payslips', 'screen', 'action', '/me/payslips']::text[], ARRAY['where to edit my payslips', 'screen for my space payslips & net pay history']::text[], 'published', 'Department Lead (' || 'hr' || ')', now(), now() + interval '90 days'),
